{"ts":"2026-08-07T17:02:34.571Z","author":"codex","author_source":"configured","agent_harness":"codex","agent_instance":"e99f29e6f7f5c51eced968bd","agent_provenance":{"model":null,"effort":null,"role":null,"topic":null},"op":"comment_add","patch":[{"op":"replace","path":"/metadata/updated_at","value":"2026-08-07T17:02:34.571Z"},{"op":"add","path":"/metadata/comments","value":[{"created_at":"2026-08-07T17:02:34.571Z","author":"codex","text":"Coverage attribution implementation is complete for the existing command integration tranche. The serialized typed harness executes production Commander callbacks in-process and preserves stdout, stderr, exit, and environment isolation; stdin- and process-isolation-sensitive tests remain black-box subprocesses. Portable validation is 1008 pass, 1 skip in 12.27s. V8 coverage improved from 44.06/45.14/54.43/43.83 to 58.44/67.32/63.29/58.69 without exclusions, ignored files, synthetic source imports, or threshold reductions. The parent 100-percent feature remains open because command families and API wrappers still have visible gaps."}]}],"before_hash":"6393f640073f9ebb2e2a7801778f1aedd9e57cb723d4907a5a204f8f6bd96935","after_hash":"2551d8ab0bb45a670f2e79c876aac695316e348772300f38b14952f52adca0a4"}
{"ts":"2026-08-07T17:05:22.754Z","author":"codex-jellyfin-coverage-20260807","author_source":"asserted","agent_harness":"codex","agent_instance":"e99f29e6f7f5c51eced968bd","agent_provenance":{"model":null,"effort":null,"role":null,"topic":null},"op":"comment_add","patch":[{"op":"add","path":"/metadata/comments/1","value":{"created_at":"2026-08-07T17:05:22.754Z","author":"codex-jellyfin-coverage-20260807","text":"Bun-native regression gate initially exposed cross-file process-state contention in the in-process harness. The harness now uses its attributable in-process path only under Vitest and preserves the established subprocess boundary under Bun. Full Bun result: 1018 pass, 185 credential-gated skips, 0 fail in 45.21s. Fresh Vitest V8 result: 1008 pass, 1 skip; 59.08 statements, 67.93 branches, 63.48 functions, 59.38 lines in 11.68s."}},{"op":"replace","path":"/metadata/updated_at","value":"2026-08-07T17:05:22.754Z"}],"before_hash":"2551d8ab0bb45a670f2e79c876aac695316e348772300f38b14952f52adca0a4","after_hash":"ea4df9203ec31a736eb9dc5bcb6798330728953e6d804b84a22fa92fd0a65a6a"}
