{"ts":"2026-08-07T17:09:35.278Z","author":"codex-jellyfin-coverage-20260807","author_source":"asserted","agent_harness":"codex","agent_instance":"e99f29e6f7f5c51eced968bd","agent_provenance":{"model":null,"effort":null,"role":null,"topic":null},"op":"comment_add","patch":[{"op":"add","path":"/metadata/comments/2","value":{"created_at":"2026-08-07T17:09:35.278Z","author":"codex-jellyfin-coverage-20260807","text":"Compiled live acceptance passed against the owner-local Jellyfin 10.11.11 instance with read-only mode forced: 185 pass, 0 fail in 130.86s. Evidence retained here is aggregate and contract-level only; credentials, identifiers, endpoints, and media payloads remain outside Git and PM. The repository release-validation pipeline also completed end to end, including build, dist smoke, package consumers, file length, tracked/history secret scans, and changelog consistency."}},{"op":"replace","path":"/metadata/updated_at","value":"2026-08-07T17:09:35.278Z"}],"before_hash":"3b993cfb962d4ed49d7d3694815e8b725f35366c2a4fcc125cbea0d572de142b","after_hash":"76645d1150ef882188e1e951c09f6eadd5a4bfaa9b5379964ccdae474810e49e"}
{"ts":"2026-08-07T17:10:12.879Z","author":"codex-jellyfin-coverage-20260807","author_source":"asserted","agent_harness":"codex","agent_instance":"e99f29e6f7f5c51eced968bd","agent_provenance":{"model":null,"effort":null,"role":null,"topic":null},"op":"comment_add","patch":[{"op":"add","path":"/metadata/comments/3","value":{"created_at":"2026-08-07T17:10:12.879Z","author":"codex-jellyfin-coverage-20260807","text":"Supply-chain and security checks are green: Bun audit and npm production audit report zero vulnerabilities; Trivy high/critical filesystem scan reports zero vulnerabilities, secrets, or misconfigurations. The strict repository jscpd gate remains red at the existing broad baseline: 225 clones and 7.55 percent duplicated lines across src, tests, and scripts. This attribution task removes repeated CLI process execution implementations from the migrated suites but does not claim to resolve unrelated production and historical test duplication; that release-readiness debt remains governed by the quality parent."}},{"op":"replace","path":"/metadata/updated_at","value":"2026-08-07T17:10:12.879Z"}],"before_hash":"76645d1150ef882188e1e951c09f6eadd5a4bfaa9b5379964ccdae474810e49e","after_hash":"114b4bef1c566f9932a094fdf1a63791a3ddc4b6db926501949dbe0678deb648"}
{"ts":"2026-08-07T17:10:22.772Z","author":"codex-jellyfin-coverage-20260807","author_source":"asserted","agent_harness":"codex","agent_instance":"e99f29e6f7f5c51eced968bd","agent_provenance":{"model":null,"effort":null,"role":null,"topic":null},"op":"note_add","patch":[{"op":"replace","path":"/metadata/updated_at","value":"2026-08-07T17:10:22.772Z"},{"op":"add","path":"/metadata/notes","value":[{"created_at":"2026-08-07T17:10:22.772Z","author":"codex-jellyfin-coverage-20260807","text":"Decision: keep Bun-native command suites on true subprocesses because Bun executes test files concurrently with isolated module queues; use the shared serialized in-process production tree only under Vitest, where one worker owns process-level capture. This preserves runtime acceptance semantics and accurate V8 attribution."}]}],"before_hash":"114b4bef1c566f9932a094fdf1a63791a3ddc4b6db926501949dbe0678deb648","after_hash":"d93349a87e5bee82f3284009380894df125bff8116241cd5ed302ca8be930aff"}
